1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:07,290
While the world is focused elsewhere, something else is happening quietly here in the occupied West Bank.

2
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:11,430
A rapid expansion, not just of settlements, but of control.

3
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:16,850
I'm standing here in the village of Sanur, north of the occupied West Bank, on the land of Tersaleh.

4
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:18,910
This land has been confiscated.

5
00:00:19,430 --> 00:00:25,750
According to Palestinian officials, this area is among dozens of sites targeted for new settlement expansion.

6
00:00:25,750 --> 00:00:34,530
According to the Colonization and Wall-Resistant Commission, Israel is planning to establish 34 new colonial sites across the West Bank.

7
00:00:34,970 --> 00:00:42,650
This marks one of the largest wave of settlement expansion in recent years, reshaping the geography of Palestinian land.

8
00:00:55,750 --> 00:01:10,690
But expansion doesn't come alone.

9
00:01:11,050 --> 00:01:16,790
In just weeks of regional tension, settlers carried out hundreds of attacks on Palestinian communities,

10
00:01:17,150 --> 00:01:20,850
from shootings to burning homes to seizing land.

11
00:01:20,850 --> 00:01:25,090
These attacks are becoming more organized and more widespread.

12
00:01:26,290 --> 00:01:32,040
This is not just about land. It's about life shrinking.

13
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:38,360
Each new outpost means less access to lands, more restrictions, and more fear.

14
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:42,460
Entire communities are being pushed away slowly, but steadily.

15
00:01:42,940 --> 00:01:46,160
This is not happening overnight, but piece by piece.

16
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:47,860
It is changing everything.

